{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"The World`s Greatest Gal Go, Go Ran Kotobuki!\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"2001-07-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ran is not your typical Gal. But what is a Gal? And what are “ironclad rules of being a Gal?” Ran Kotobuki will teach you! Join Ran as she helps spread world peace, all while being a Gal!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1525711.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"天下のギャル♥イケイケ→寿蘭\"},{\"title\":\"Phone Tag Gets Chilling! Shibuya Is Thrilling! The Great Dragnet\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"2001-07-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ran is promised 500 yen to right 10 wrongs. Her first right was catching a girl who tried to steal a purse, but will it turn out to be as mundane a theft as it appears?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1525721.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"渋谷♥ハラハラ→大捜査線\"},{\"title\":\"A Girl`s Feelings! Hearts Reeling! Red Streak or Not, Miyu`s Taken!\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"2001-07-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Things get creepy when Miyu receives a weird love letter in her shoe locker. Will Yamato come to Miyu’s rescue? Ran’s back on the case to help her friend!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1525731.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"オンナゴコロ♥ドキドキ→赤メッシュ\"},{\"title\":\"Have Got? Have Not? Luck with Guys!\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"2001-07-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Gals are telling their love fortunes, but the future looks bleak for Ran. But when Ran does find love, is he really the right guy for her?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1525741.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"アルアル?♥ナイナイ?→おとこ運?\"},{\"title\":\"Fresh Start? Broken Heart? Is It Over with Aya?\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"2001-08-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Its exam time and Ran is struggling through them. The bigger problem is top-of-her-class Aya falls several ranks in the scores. She distances herself from Ran and Miyu to get better grades, but what about her Gal life?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1525751.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ハート♥バラバラ→綾と絶交!?\"},{\"title\":\"Gals Rule the Pool! Too Cool! Junior Detectives!\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2001-08-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ran’s got a new swimsuit, so she wants to show it off at the pool! But her day off could have severe consequences when the ’Bukuro Gals try to take over Shibuya. Aya’s after Rei and Yuuya’s after Ran in their fun day at the pool.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1525781.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"プール♥ワクワク→チューボー刑事!\"},{\"title\":\"A Black Shadow Creeping Up Behind Her! Miyu Is a Target!\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"2001-08-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Miyu’s trying to do 100 good deeds to fulfill her wish, but her past might catch up to her and balance out those good deeds.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1525791.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"黒い影♥ヒタヒタ→狙われた美由\"},{\"title\":\"A Gal`s Heart! A Guilty Heart! Miyu`s Past Catches Up!\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"2001-08-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Thugs from an old gang have attacked Miyu and everyone is trying to figure out who the culprit really is. Detective Ran Kotobuki is back on the case to help her ailing friend.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1525811.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ココロ♥チクチク→美由の過去\"},{\"title\":\"Memories! Tearful Memories! Sayo`s Been Kidnapped?\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2001-08-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In Shibuya, Sayo and Masato are protecting the peace from ne’er-do-wells. Under the watchful eye of Yamato, Sayo’s learning what it really means to be a police officer. But when Sayo gets kidnapped, no one in the Kotobuki family really knows what’s going\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1525831.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"想い出♥ボロボロ→沙夜が誘拐?\"},{\"title\":\"Second Place Yuya? He`s First Place Nervous! A Rival Appears!\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2001-09-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Second Place Yuuya is trying to confess to Ran, but he’s having a little trouble doing so. Then Tatsuki Kuroi appears and challenges Ran’s parapara dancing abilities as things heat up a little in Shibuya.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1525841.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"裕也♥ソワソワ→ライバル登場!\"},{\"title\":\"Crisscrossing Shibuya! Fun Fun! It`s a Grand Prix!\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"2001-06-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Yuuya’s a little down over being second place, but when Ran calls him up, all his worries seem to disappear. Things get complicated as Ran decides to hold a contest to decide who will become her boyfriend! What’ll become of Yuuya?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"渋谷横断♥チキチキ→グランプリ\"},{\"title\":\"A Promise Kept! Bye-Bye! Kendo Girl!\",\"number\":12,\"airDate\":\"2001-09-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Ran and Kendo Club member Shiori have to do a makeup class, they decide to hang out in Shibuya afterwards. But all Shiori wants is to dress like a girl, and Gal extraordinaire Ran is there to help.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1525891.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"約束♥バイバイ→剣道少女\"},{\"title\":\"Super Debutante! Super Goody-Goody! Ran Kotobuki!\",\"number\":13,\"airDate\":\"2001-09-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Miyu and Aya wish Ran were a little more studious, she’s suddenly and suspiciously acting different. The Junior Detectives are back on the case to find out what happened to Ran!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1525901.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"超お嬢様♥ブリブリ→寿蘭\"},{\"title\":\"Meet Maki! The Shiny, New First Year Gal!\",\"number\":14,\"airDate\":\"2001-10-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Country Girl Maki comes to Shibuya to be an apprentice to Ran. But when Maki wants her idol to demonstrate how much of a Gal Ran truly is, will she be able to survive her own Ironclad Rules for Gals?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1525921.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"真希♥ピカピカ→ギャル1年生!\"},{\"title\":\"Cold Revenge? It`s Burning Hot! Snowboard Battle!\",\"number\":15,\"airDate\":\"2001-10-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Ran wins a snowboard in a lottery, she’s taking everyone snowboarding! But in the summer? However, Yuuya might gain a leg up over Tatsukichi in the competition for Ran.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1525931.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"リベンジ♥メラメラ→スノボバトル!\"},{\"title\":\"Dappled Sunlight! Sparkling Away! A Romantic Anniversary!\",\"number\":16,\"airDate\":\"2001-10-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Two years ago, Miyu was a troublemaker in a gang and the school doesn’t know what to do. But when Ran gets caught bringing in snacks and music to school, the teachers coerce her into rehabilitating Miyu.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1525951.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"木洩れ陽♥キラキラ→恋愛記念日\"},{\"title\":\"Feelings of Love! Start Wavering: Aya Confesses?\",\"number\":17,\"airDate\":\"2001-10-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Miyu brings in a romance personality test, Aya gets worried about her results. Ran and her friends spur Aya on to confess her true love to Rei.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1525971.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"恋ゴコロ♥ユラユラ→綾が告白!?\"},{\"title\":\"Odaiba Excitement! Crackling Action! The Great Final Battle!\",\"number\":18,\"airDate\":\"2001-10-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Odaiba! It’s vacation time for Ran and her friends, and this time Ran is playing Aya’s wingman in the quest for Rei’s love. But when Ran gets separated from the rest of the group, she finds herself accepting a challenge from Mami.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1525991.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"お台場♥バチバチ→大決戦!\"},{\"title\":\"The Sun, Sun, Sun Summer Girl!\",\"number\":19,\"airDate\":\"2001-11-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ran’s broke again, so Yamato suggests she gets a job. But he gets a shock when he finds Ran when at the beach while he’s trying to relax with Miyu.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526011.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"太陽♥サンサン→夏オンナ!\"},{\"title\":\"Dreamy-Eyed Mami! Her First Love!\",\"number\":20,\"airDate\":\"2001-11-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Mami’s broken up with her boyfriend, but her first love is coming to Japan. To top it all off, he wants to go to Shibuya! What’ll happens when Ran shows up?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526041.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"マミリン♥メロメロ→初恋の人\"},{\"title\":\"It`s Certain Victory! Go! Go! Sports Fest\",\"number\":21,\"airDate\":\"2001-11-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Summer break is over, but Ran’s neglected her summer homework. However, if she wins the sports festival for her class, Mr. Nakanishi will look the other way on her homework. Can Ran pull it off?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526051.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"必勝♥ゴーゴー→体育祭\"},{\"title\":\"High School Culture Fest! Para-Para Meisho Queen!\",\"number\":22,\"airDate\":\"2001-11-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"It’s Meisho’s culture festival and the Gals got tickets from Rei. Yamato’s hired the Junior Detectives to make sure no cute Meisho guys take away Miyu, Aya and Rei are still working out their relationship, and Ran and Mami clash for Meisho Queen.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526071.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"学祭♥パラパラ→明匠クイーン\"},{\"title\":\"Tear It Off! Rip, Rip! Teacher`s Gold Leaf Exterior!\",\"number\":23,\"airDate\":\"2001-12-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Gunjo’s sore over losing the Sports Festival and he’s taking out his frustrations on class captain, Takezawa. He’s also got it out for Ran over winning the Festival. But it’s certain that Ran won’t stand for this kind of injustice.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526081.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"はがせ♥ベリベリ→教師のメッキ\"},{\"title\":\"Off to Machida! The Monkey Leaves! Tatsukichi Gets Dumped?!\",\"number\":24,\"airDate\":\"2001-12-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Gals are telling fortunes again and today happens to be Ran’s luckiest day of the year. But the next day, Ran’s gushing over her luck and tries the fortune game again only to find that her unluckiest days are ahead.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526091.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"町田へ♥サル去る→タツキチ失恋!?\"},{\"title\":\"Yamato`s Dead Serious! Yamato Proposes?!\",\"number\":25,\"airDate\":\"2001-12-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Gals are out looking for jobs again, but they’re being turned down for their looks. When they do find a job at a pastry shop, they have to sell 3,000 Gal pastries by the end of the day. With the help of Rei and Yuuya, it could happen!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526101.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"大和♥マジマジ→プロポーズ!?\"},{\"title\":\"Hard-Working Super Cop, Ran Kotobuki!\",\"number\":26,\"airDate\":\"2001-12-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Ran wins a sleep learning pillow in a raffle, she accidentally brainwashes herself into wanting to become a police officer. But what will happen of Ran’s normal Gal life?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526111.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"超刑事♥バリバリ→寿蘭\"},{\"title\":\"Brother! Kichi-Kichi! Naokichi Appears!\",\"number\":27,\"airDate\":\"2002-01-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"It’s another Tatsuki.  He’s an easy-going boy on a skateboard in Shibuya, and he resembles someone... Who’s the guy? Naoki - Tatsuki’s brother!  When he falls in love with Ran, it’s a brother-brother ramen battle for her love!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526131.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ブラザー♥キチキチ→ナオキチ見参!\"},{\"title\":\"Yuya! Crying! Talks About Being a Man\",\"number\":28,\"airDate\":\"2002-01-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naoki falls for Miyu, but what will he do when he discovers she’s in love with Yamato? Then, when Ran loses her wallet, Yuya sets out to find it.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526161.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"裕也♥ナクナク→男を語る\"},{\"title\":\"Mami-rin! Lovey-Dovey! Falls for Yuya!\",\"number\":29,\"airDate\":\"2002-01-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Mami discovers that her boyfriend is cheating and when Yuya shows up to console her - it’s pure love!  However, when she finds out Yuya only has eyes for Ran, she challenges Ran to a fight!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526171.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"マミリン♥ラブラブ→裕也にほれる\"},{\"title\":\"Bukuro! In Circles! Mystery of the Extension!\",\"number\":30,\"airDate\":\"2002-01-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Mami’s got a new hair extension! But what’s this? Mysterious men have shown up to take it away!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526181.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ブクロ♥グルグル→エクステの謎\"},{\"title\":\"Welcome! Exciting! Palm Tree Grand Opening!\",\"number\":31,\"airDate\":\"2002-01-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Legendary gal idol Towa Himejima returns to Shibuya to open up a new café called Palm Tree! But when someone tries to disturb her business, Ran takes it personally and searches for the criminal.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526191.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ウェルカム♥ウキウキ→開店! パームツリー\"},{\"title\":\"Ran-pyon! Irritated! A New Rival?!\",\"number\":32,\"airDate\":\"2002-02-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After Miyu’s cell phone goes missing, Ran gets an anonymous call, telling her to stop being a gal or Miyu’s cell phone will be broken!  Then suddenly, Aya has her train pass stolen. Who’s behind it all?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526211.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"蘭ぴょん♥イライラ→新たなライバル!?\"},{\"title\":\"Kasumi! Pissed! The Great Plot for Revenge!\",\"number\":33,\"airDate\":\"2002-02-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ran’s got a wannabe rival on the scene - Kasumi Tsukino. When Ran doesn’t take her seriously, Kasumi tries to get even by setting up traps for her in Shibuya.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526221.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"カスミ♥ムカムカ→リベンジ大作戦!\"},{\"title\":\"Aya-ppe - Teary-Eyed - Otohata Syndrome\",\"number\":34,\"airDate\":\"2002-02-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Aya starts having problems with Otohata and when a new boy named Katase arrives on the scene, she starts to doubt her relationship with Otohata.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526231.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"綾っぺ♥ウルウル→乙幡病\"},{\"title\":\"Romantic Forecast! Unclear! Otohata Then Katase?!\",\"number\":35,\"airDate\":\"2002-02-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Aya is caught between the two men in her life - Otohata and Katase.  Who will she choose?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526241.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"恋愛予報♥モヤモヤ→乙幡のち片瀬!?\"},{\"title\":\"Hot Spring! Viva Viva! The Gal Incident in the Northern Steam Clouds\",\"number\":36,\"airDate\":\"2002-03-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Maki Komine invites Ran to her family’s hotel. With Sayo, Masato and Naoki in tow, it’s time for some gal fun at the hot spring! But when a big crime is committed, and Ran becomes the prime suspect!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526251.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"温泉♥ビバビバ→北の湯けむりギャル事件\"},{\"title\":\"Secret! Revelead! Mami-rin in Danger!\",\"number\":37,\"airDate\":\"2002-03-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Mami’s big secret is revealed, she gets seriously worried about her relationship with Yuya. Will he still want to be with her?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526261.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"秘密♥バレバレ→マミリンの危機!\"},{\"title\":\"Heart! Aching! Otohata`s Words\",\"number\":38,\"airDate\":\"2002-03-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Naka-teach asks Ran for a weird favor.  He wants her to make rounds with him on his night duty at school because he saw a ghost?!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526271.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ココロ♥ジンジン→乙幡の言葉\"},{\"title\":\"Christmas Eve! Jingle-Jingle! Emergency Bell of Love\",\"number\":39,\"airDate\":\"2002-03-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"It’s Christmas time! Ran and Tatsuki get involved in an incident where their relationship is tested!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526281.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"聖夜♥リンリン→恋の非常ベル\"},{\"title\":\"Ran-pyon! Dizzy! Becomes Sayo?!\",\"number\":40,\"airDate\":\"2002-04-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"It’s New Year’s Day and Sayo is upset when Ran gets a bigger New Year’s gift than she did, and dreams of being the older sister. When she buys a good luck bag, it switches Sayo and Ran’s personalities!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526291.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"蘭ぴょん♥クラクラ→沙夜になる!?\"},{\"title\":\"Shibuya Soldier! Mysterious! Maru-Q Moon!\",\"number\":41,\"airDate\":\"2002-04-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Shibuya is in trouble, Maru-Q Moon comes to rescue! The whole town is talking about her! Who is this hero in disguise?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526301.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"渋谷戦士♥ナゾナゾ→マルキュームーン\"},{\"title\":\"Taizo! Enthousiastic! Police Training Project!\",\"number\":42,\"airDate\":\"2002-04-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Taizo remembers the days when Ran was in elementary school and wanted to become a cop!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526311.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"泰三♥ノリノリ→警官養成プロジェクト!\"},{\"title\":\"Pure Love! Nervous! Rie`s Love Tale\",\"number\":43,\"airDate\":\"2002-04-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Rie secretly admires Junichi Ota who saved her in elementary school when bullies picked on her.  Why can’t she express her feelings to him? And why does he seem to be avoiding her?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526321.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"純情♥モジモジ→理恵の恋バナ\"},{\"title\":\"Killed in the Line of Duty! Weeping! Odaiba Shark`s Final Day!\",\"number\":44,\"airDate\":\"2002-05-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Odaiba Cop’s Detective Kudoh dies on duties, Sayo’s not the only one crying.  Matsuda, who plays the role of Detective Kudo, can’t seem to find another gig and winds up back in Shibuya where he used to hang out when he was younger...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526331.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"殉職♥シクシク→お台場シャーク最後の日!\"},{\"title\":\"Signs of Love! various! Valentine`s Day\",\"number\":45,\"airDate\":\"2002-05-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"It’s Valentine’s Day!  Tatsuki wants chocolate from Ran, but Ran doesn’t seem inclined. Is their relationship over? They’re not the only ones having trouble. Rei seems to be looking at another girl lately…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526341.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"恋模様♥イロイロ→バレンタインデー\"},{\"title\":\"Clash! Slurp! Slurp! Ramen Battle!\",\"number\":46,\"airDate\":\"2002-05-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Is the Kuroi family in serious trouble?  A new ramen noodle chain opens up near the Kuroi’s noodle house, and begins spreading vicious rumors about them!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526351.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"激突♥チュルチュル→ラーメンバトル!\"},{\"title\":\"Kasumi! Toasty Warm! Her Dream Coat\",\"number\":47,\"airDate\":\"2002-05-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kasumi falls in love with a coat she sees at a store that resembles a coat one of Kasumi’s role models wore.  Unfortunately for Kasumi, Ran also has her eye on the coat!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526361.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"カスミ♥ポカポカ→憧れのコート\"},{\"title\":\"Gal Battle! Fierce! Mami-rin Finished?!\",\"number\":48,\"airDate\":\"2002-05-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When things get rocky for Yuya and Mami, Mami blames it on Ran and challenges her to a final showdown at the Girls’ Festival!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/134151/1526371.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ギャルバトル♥ガンガン→マミリン破局!?\"},{\"title\":\"Heartbreak! Painful! Miyu`s 